# Omar-6 Opt3 — locked default (2026-08-16)

Do **not** change this unless the user says so. One train entry:
`scripts/slurm_train_opt3_slidebag.sh` → `src/train_uni2_opt3_slidebag.py`.
Never `src/train_uni2_upernet.py` for Opt3.

## Must be true at process start (abort if not)

- `--live-patches 64` and ISUP `perm` uses **`live_n=64`**, never `micro_batch_size` (live **5443101** bug).
- Log line `WIRING_OK live=64 (not micro=4)`.
- `--lora` and `lora_params_in_optimizer>0` (else abort). UNI2 base frozen 100 epochs.
- 1×1 FPN proj **outside** backbone `no_grad`.
- Live ISUP: chunk forward + **`--decoder-checkpoint`** so backward **recomputes one chunk**; loss is still the **mean of all 64**. Do not go back to live=4.
- Backbone `--grad-checkpoint` on.
- n&lt;5 → `L_seg` only. `λ_slide` warmup. Decoder GN. Absolute-area soft ISUP.

